{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"视线先落在左上方白色大字“以后也不变”，随后被下方更醒目的紫色问句“少露些心意，会不会少疼些？”吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"像是在犹豫要不要少表达一些心意，以免自己受伤；具体遭遇和处境不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"怕疼、犹豫、顾虑。\",\n  \"missed\": \"刚得到某种幸福或拥有某种东西，却发现它留不住；原本的幸福感逐渐掺入尖锐、暗沉的悲伤，幸福没有消失，但悲伤进入了幸福之中。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"白色标题“以后也不变”和紫色问句都比较醒目，需要从第一块转向第二块才能确定这一屏的主题。\",\n    \"放大的问句能传达怕受伤的顾虑，但本身说不清具体处境。\",\n    \"核心处境和幸福与悲伤之间的关系分散在下方说明文字里，需要读完整并与标题拼接才能理解。\",\n    \"下方两行文字连续排布，包含多个意思，快速扫视不容易同时抓住。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c692be78-8850-4403-91c4-27b068cd5667", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T021553216123Z", "elapsed_seconds": 21.843, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:16:15.061702+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3635d62f4c7e8268dd7713a998ddadd3b7794acfd189893adfd9417afbb0a5de", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f1